## Intensity (scan, not chat)

Intensity changes how aggressive the detectors are, not a persona.

| Level | Effect |
|---|---|
| `off` | Playbook no-ops. Used when a composed run should skip lean. |
| `lite` | Emit only `newdep`, `native`, `reuse` with inbound evidence >= 2. |
| `full` | All tags. Default. |
| `ultra` | Also include `wrapper` and `dead_flex` at 14-180 day age. Still confirmed-only. Still no auto-apply. |

`CODEMIND_LEAN_MODE` env or `options.intensity` on the run payload.

