## Eval fixtures (CI of the playbook itself)

| Id | Repo fixture | Must emit | Must not emit |
|---|---|---|---|
| E1 | Signup with `flatpickr` used once | `native` + `newdep` | — |
| E2 | `formatMoney` exists; a second copy with 0 inbound | `reuse` on the copy | `reuse` on the original |
| E3 | `AbstractRepo` + one impl | `yagni` | — |
| E4 | `sanitizeUploadName` on a path-join taint path | — | any cut of the sanitizer |
| E5 | `lru_cache` already on the fetch | Lean already for cache-class | a new cache class finding |

Promotion rule: a detector ships to `full` estate only if E1-E5 stay green and PR-mode false-positive sample on 20 internal repos is < 15%.

