## What this is not allowed to become

- A Copilot instruction file with a seven-rung pep talk.
- A second health-audit that re-implements taint or CVE.
- An estate-wide auto-refactor bot.
- A finding stream of `heuristic` guesses dressed as `confirmed`.

CodeMind already scans at service scale. This playbook adds the YAGNI dimension to that scan, on the same orchestrator, the same graph, the same Mongo/UI, the same batch runner.
